/-!
# Checked cell admission through occurrence and received HOL interfaces

The package connects the actual t-ISA checked-admission relation, its guarded
resource theory, an occurrence implementation of Interface.Step, and the
received general HOL admission/run theory. It preserves the declared cell
readout and exact finite execution lengths; occurrence origins remain in the
event paths.

The native record package reads the actual twenty-nine source cases and
relates their same-history instance contract to prepared field admission,
including source guards, result effects and explicit permission. It retains
the ten actual field types and conservative read/take footprints. Concrete
closed-packet proof transport, preparation and stream authority, and the
named native implementation refinement remain separate obligations.

The constrained-information queue profile has actual program firings and
run correspondence in both directions. A satisfying environment is carried
through the observation, and every supplied raw finite run lifts at each
compatible final environment. Its data paths preserve the actual firing word.
Each queue firing consumes one request, which gives exact finite progress and
observation lifting for the existing modal operators. The controls distinguish
this observation from forgetting the environment: narrowing can discard an
old solution, and that raw projection need not lift futures. This profile uses
a bag, one-match commits, guards after tells, fixed rules and one store; these
are the represented profile's parameters.

The public proposition-rule caller is instantiated from its actual finite
entry observations. The bridge derives the decoded premise and spatial
protections, retains the complete caller effects, and reads the written output
without assuming initialized output bytes. This separate rule-table instance
does not supply the remaining representation of all twenty-nine HOL cases.

The local theorem-row producer checks a supplied literal against the actual
eight-byte load and retains its complete execution outcome. Its source adapter
uses an independently supplied field and constructor-image witness, with exact
HD/CONS and SND/PAIR readings in the same carried model. This is a forward
projection; the required source-law reception, general table decoding and
the native implementation of complete record guards remain separate.

In the original prepared field program, every made row is a field cell.
Certificate-origin laws for arbitrary actual firings and finite runs retain
the original occurrence and payload under the actual frame pullback. These
schemas therefore cannot create their own next certificate. A named ingress
or driver is required to connect consecutive prepared calls.

Numbered input envelopes compose at their actual next identifier and retain
row order and repeated bodies. Total row decoders earn syntax-cache licences
from earlier-reference checks. Readback is unique at a fixed index for fixed
rows and provenance-bearing symbols, including across distinct licensed
caches. The captured initial truth-body records pass through both decoders
and the existing definition admission. Signature formation, changing symbol
histories, full file identity and proof-command reception retain their own
obligations; syntax readback grants no theorem authority.

The checked visible-lookup licence transports old syntax certificates while
permitting new bindings. It preserves first-match values, including when
hidden duplicate entries change. A smaller query can survive a rebinding
even when this sufficient whole-registry licence fails. No global immutable
namespace or cross-history interpretation is inferred.

Total well-founded reference queries are sound and complete for the actual
source-node certificates. Successful licensed cache reads agree with them.
The numbered proof reader uses these queries to construct all ten source
inference requests and explicit fixed-policy axiom requests. Actual primitive
checking, parent-address checking and output comparison remain in the existing
registered kernel. Prepared candidates retain kind, origin and primitive
check evidence; consumers also retain successful preparation at the exact
receiving state. Input-window replay uses each preceding result as the next
state and yields an actual registered path. Declaration reception, complete
file identity and identification with the older partial runtime reader remain
separate. The controls preserve the named source BETA guard rather than
replacing it with unrestricted beta conversion.

Registered proof blocks retain the exact declaration context, ordered cache
addresses and command receipts, including both outputs of a type definition.
Sized append views preserve that same Array while supporting balanced parent
selection in generated proofs. A selected source interpretation is carried
through proof suffixes with its actual model retained; fresh independently
selected replay frames are not identified. Checked source prefixes are
controls, while complete literal-packet quotation remains separate.

The product constructor reads actual projection seeds and Boolean definitions,
builds checked generalization and type-instantiation suffixes, and returns its
product bundle only after twenty-seven exact final reads. Native admission,
packing and the old case facts use that one carried frame. Runtime qualification
of the complete product suffix and the full literal import remain separate
from these checked construction and composition laws.
-/
